WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.530
- Like the rest of the
world at this moment,

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.820
I'm obsessed with Dua Lipa, all right.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.250
She was, I mean, she's
awesome, so that's why.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.890
She was a battle round adviser
on "The Voice" last season

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.310
for Team Kelly as well,
so she has great taste.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:13.450
Let's start with that.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.980
And she couldn't have been nicer.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.490
It's always nice to like, meet
people you adore musically,

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.480
and then they live up to
your expectations as a human

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.600
in real life.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.890
But the other day she
had a big announcement.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.220
It was so secret in fact,

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.970
she called me before the
audience got into the house seats

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.000
at our studio so they
couldn't hear yet either.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.580
And we can finally share
what she had to say.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.080
So check it out.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.260
Hey, what's up, Dua?

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.787
How you doing?

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:36.766
Where are you?

00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:38.100
- I'm good, I'm in London.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.230
It's nice to see you, how are you?

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:41.612
- I'm good actually, I'm great.

00:00:41.612 --> 00:00:44.610
Life is getting so much better, right?

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.900
So before I forget though,

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.630
thank you so much for helping
Team Kelly on "The Voice."

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:50.463
Did you have fun?

00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:51.690
You were so good at it.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:52.523
- Oh, thank you.

00:00:52.523 --> 00:00:53.450
I had so much fun.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.260
It was definitely such a new experience

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.930
but it was so cool to
get to learn next to you

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.310
and see the way that you mentor everyone.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.860
It was really amazing and
super inspiring, I loved it.

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:03.693
- Oh man.

00:01:03.693 --> 00:01:05.310
Well, ditto, you have such
a great energy about you,

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:06.790
you're such a light, it was so fun.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.301
And I love your music so much.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:10.610
It was just, it was cool to
like, love someone musically

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.280
and then you lived up like as a human.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.283
Like, sometimes that
doesn't always happen.

